### 1.1 Fix destructive patch application (Bug #1 — CRITICAL)

#### [MODIFY] cli_engine.py (lines ~2073-2078)

**Problem:** Blanks out ALL lines in range, dumps AI output into line 1 — destroys error handlers, closing braces, valid logic.

**Fix:** Precision line replacement that only touches the vulnerable line(s):
