### 6.1 Patch memory (reuse verified fixes)

#### [NEW] backend/rag/patch_memory.py

```python
class PatchMemory:
    """Cache verified patches. Keyed by (cwe, framework, sink_pattern)."""
    
    def __init__(self, path=".cyphex_patch_memory.json"):
        self.path = path
        self.memory = self._load()
    
    def recall(self, cwe, framework, sink_pattern):
        key = f"{cwe}:{framework}:{sink_pattern}"
        return self.memory.get(key)
    
    def store(self, cwe, framework, sink_pattern, patch, verified=True):
        if not verified:
            return  # Only remember verified patches
        key = f"{cwe}:{framework}:{sink_pattern}"
        self.memory[key] = {
            "patch": patch,
            "stored_at": datetime.now().isoformat(),
            "reuse_count": 0,
        }
        self._save()
```

