## Success Metrics

- **Patch durability rate** — % of patches where the vuln does NOT reappear on re-scan. Target: >95%
- **Verified-patch rate** — should be 100% by definition once Phase 2 lands
- **Mean reflexion rounds** — lower = better context/RAG. Target: <2
- **Template hit rate** — % of vulns fixed by deterministic transforms. Target: >50%
- **Zero fake greens** — the degradation ladder (Phase 2) guarantees if you can't verify, you can't claim "fixed"

